<title>JAPAN: Pioneer Electronic - 3qtr group results.</title>
<headline>Pioneer Electronic - 3qtr group results.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-02-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Three months to December 31, 1996</p>
<p> (Group)	(in billions of yen unless specified)</p>
<p> Sales		147.39		vs	  142.60</p>
<p> Operating	    3.68		vs	  989    million</p>
<p> Current		5.33		vs	    1.27</p>
<p> Net		    3.15		vs	    1.03</p>
<p> EPS		   17.56 yen	  vs	    5.71 yen</p>
<p>NOTE - Pioneer Electronic Corp specialises in audio equipment. (Figures are reported based on U.S. accounting rules.)</p>
